      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MONSIEUR FLAMEL (6) led from a similar barrier and kept kicking only to be edged out last time at Geelong. That was his fourth successive top-three result including a win from the second line here two back. Can continue the strong form. MY ATLANTIS (3) is in a purple patch of form. Made it two wins in succession from back row draws when making up plenty of ground to score by a nose at Geelong at the most recent appearance. Likely to get the favours from this nice draw so could land the hat trick. LIKE A GAZELLE (4) is looming as a real threat after a good effort last start, coming from wider for a close second at this circuit and distance. BREATHE EASY (7) cannot be left out after solid recent performances, the latest a sound third from this barrier at Geelong.",
